, "When Azorius Arrester enters the battlefield, detain target creature an opponent controls. (Until your next turn, that creature can't attack or block and its activated abilities can't be activated.)", "When Azorius Justiciar enters the battlefield, detain up to two target creatures your opponents control. (Until your next turn, those creatures can't attack or block and their activated abilities can't be activated.)", 'When Carnage Interpreter enters the battlefield, discard your hand, then investigate four times. (To investigate, create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nAs long as you have one or fewer cards in hand, Carnage Interpreter gets +2/+2 and has menace.', 'When Dagger Caster enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each opponent and 1 damage to each creature your opponents control.', "When Deadbridge Chant enters the battlefield, mill ten cards.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, choose a card at random in your graveyard. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Duskshell Crawler enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Footlight Fiend dies, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Frenzied Gorespawn enters the battlefield, for each opponent, goad target creature that player controls. (Until your next turn, those creatures attack each combat if able and attack a player other than you if able.)\\nWhenever one or more creatures attack one of your opponents, those creatures gain menace until end of turn.', 'When Jeering Homunculus enters the battlefield, you may goad target creature. (Until your next turn, that creature attacks each combat if able and attacks a player other than you if able.)', 'When Living Lightning dies, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Mausoleum Turnkey enters the battlefield, return target creature card of an opponent's choice from your graveyard to your hand.", "When Sage's Row Savant enters the battlefield, scry 2.", 'When Seller of Songbirds enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying.', 'When Tithebearer Giant enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Urbis Protector enters the battlefield, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', "When Yeva's Forcemage enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", 'When you cast this spell, you gain half X life and draw half X cards. Round down each time.\\nFlying, trample\\nHydroid Krasis enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Whenever Emissary Green attacks, starting with you, each player votes for profit or security. You create a number of Treasure tokens equal to twice the number of profit votes. Put a number of +1/+1 counters on each creature you control equal to the number of security votes.', "Whenever Frenzied Goblin attacks, you may pay {R}. If you do, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever Mastermind Plum attacks, exile up to one target card from a graveyard. If an artifact card was exiled this way, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nWhenever you cast a spell, if mana from a Treasure was spent to cast it, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Whenever Ornery Goblin blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Ornery Goblin deals 1 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever Orzhov Racketeers deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.\\nAfterlife 2 (When this creature dies, create two 1/1 white and black Spirit creature tokens with flying.)', 'Whenever Tribune of Rot attacks, mill two cards. For each creature card milled this way, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "Whenever Undercover Butler attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, it can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever Vernal Sovereign enters the battlefield or attacks, create a green and white Elemental creature token with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control."', 'Whenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, Territorial Boar gets +1/+1 and gains vigilance until end of turn.', 'Whenever another creature you control dies, Vindictive Vampire deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another green creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Spellgorger Weird.', "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani's Pridemate.", 'Whenever you sacrifice a permanent, Havoc Jester deals 1 damage to any target.', "Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for a nonland permanent you don't control. Exile each permanent with the most votes or tied for most votes.", '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Tap target creature with mana value 2 or greater.', '{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}{U}: Roofstalker Wight gains flying until end of turn.', '{2}{U}: Adapt 2. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put two +1/+1 counters on it.)', "{2}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{2}{W}: Target player gains 1 life.\\n{2}{B}: Each player loses 1 life.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{3}{G}: Gravel-Hide Goblin gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "{3}{R}: Target creature can't block this turn.", '{3}{U}: Steeple Creeper gains flying until end of turn.', '{4}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n{4}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', '{4}{G}{G}: Adapt 4. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put four +1/+1 counters on it.)', '{5}{G}: Kraul Warrior gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{B}: Twilight Panther gains deathtouch until end of turn.', '{U/R}: Frostburn Weird gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{W}, Sacrifice Transluminant: Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying at the beginning of the next end step.', '{W}: Towering Thunderfist gains vigilance until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"\'Invincible\' is just a word."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"A company of infantry is trapped behind the lines. We need to strike hard and fast to free them, or the casualties will be horrific. Send the griffins."\\n—Tajic', '"Advanced Elemental Manifestations is canceled until all students have thawed."\\n—Prismari dormitory notice', '"All the coins in Ravnica can\'t save his soul now."\\n—Narbulg Nine Fingers', '"Anything a falcon can do, a bat can do in pitch darkness."\\n—Urdnan the Wanderer', '"Attention, brawlers! You are in violation of Senate statute 2309.76-22. Halt your melee before you incur further charges."', '"Automatons are fast, precise, and tireless, but they all share one weakness: predictability. Learn their patterns. Strike when they\'re vulnerable."\\n—Horance, Urzan general', '"Before I let you wield one of these, let\'s see you dodge one!"', '"Before they can go to their final rest, the wicked must be purified by fire."\\n—Harra the Adjudicator', '"By all means, take another step toward the captain."', '"Did you expect me to dodge? How quaint."\\n—Olka, mistmeadow witch', '"Entertain me."', '"Entrance is free. Donations are required."\\n—Notice outside Vizkopa Bank', '"Even this primitive specimen of my kind is impressive."\\n—Niv-Mizzet', '"Feed the rumor mills with delicious treachery. Bad blood between those two is a good deal for us."\\n—Kamiz, Obscura Oculus', '"Forget yourself. Forget your city. Forget your homes, your families, the debts and obligations that hold you to this world."', '"Forward! Until the horizon is ours!"\\n—Khemses, charioteer', '"Have you ever held a Boros signet? There\'s a weight to it that belies its size—a weight of strength and of pride."\\n—Agrus Kos', '"Hold on to your ideals. They\'ll be tested more than your armor or the edge of your blade."\\n—Tajic', '"How did we find each other? So there I was, exploring a mound of monster corpses..."', '"I bestow upon you a great honor—your flesh alone will nourish a new generation of saprolings."', '"I can see which way the wind is blowing."', '"I hear that Boros is losing its angels to the Gateless Movement. I\'m sure this comes as no surprise to you."\\n—Teysa, to Lazav', '"I was never here."', '"I\'ve always said full war chests win wars, but I didn\'t mean by bashing enemy skulls with them."\\n—Teysa', '"If the Fin Clade cannot produce a reliable venomous krasis, mobile in both air and water, then the Guardian Project will absorb its resources."\\n—Vannifar', '"If there were such a thing as a soul, I think it would be behind the gallbladder but above the kidneys."', '"It is our duty to protect all those in need. But the other guilds have never shown themselves worthy of that protection."\\n—Tajic', '"Keep coming. I have knives enough for everyone."', '"Keep up with me, comrades, or I cannot guarantee you a fair share of the fracas."', '"Lady Wren is the one merchant in Keyhole Downs who isn\'t running a scam."\\n—Mirela, Azorius hussar', '"Life has no mistakes, only experiments."\\n—Yolov, Simic bioengineer', '"Looks like you need protection."', '"Many have sought snake-twined Pharika\'s panacea. Do you wish to share their fate?"', '"Many wings haunt the skies these days. Few of them bear good tidings."\\n—Lavinia', '"Might doesn\'t just build empires. It protects them."\\n—Inti, Sun Empire knight', '"Most compete for insects at street level. Some dwell near Izzet laboratories and ride the thermal updrafts."\\n—Yolov, Simic bioengineer', '"My doors are called trespassing, my signatures, forgeries. They don\'t respect my talents, and I don\'t respect their labels."', '"My favorite meal is angel\'s flesh, slain in agony and iced with black vinegar."\\n—Aszala of House Dimir', '"My specialty is theoretical universal limits and ways to circumvent them."', '"Nature can\'t be stopped. It rips and tears at Ravnica\'s tallest buildings to claim its place in the sun."', '"Nature is a wonderful engineer but works far too slowly for my tastes."', '"No harm can come to me while the Worldsoul shelters me."', '"No peace accord will save Ravnica. You don\'t build on rot. You burn it down and start again."\\n—Domri Rade', '"Nobody ever listens to my complaints! Not even when I use the listening stick."', '"Nothing ruins a party like one of those big killjoys bursting through the door and setting all the guests free."\\n—Ruba, Rakdos cultist', '"Now, little fighter, show me you deserved this second chance."', '"Places, everyone!"\\n—Judith', '"Quiet in the library" soon gave way to larger concerns.', '"Ribbit."', '"See that no one enters or leaves New Prahv today. And notify me at once of any Planeswalker activity."\\n—Dovin Baan', '"Selesnya\'s soil is sacred, and you\'re about to meet it with your face."', '"Skyknight gear? Well, I have drake-skin gauntlets, supple and fireproof. Or a ceratok chestplate that\'ll stop a crossbow bolt."', '"So much wealth. So much splendor. So much temptation to believe the gilded lie."\\n—Kaya', '"That\'s a pretty ring! Trade you my knife for it."', '"The blood of the enemy is a sacrament. The strength it gives is proof that our cause is just."', '"The louder their performance, the quieter we become in comparison. They are the perfect distractions, for only fools ignore the Rakdos."\\n—Lazav', '"The most elegant solutions are found in nature. You just have to know where to look."', '"The next punch you throw hits the back of your own head."', '"The presence of the strong will make you stronger."\\n—Yeva, Nature\'s Herald', '"The reign of the Swarm begins. Let us rise now and dress ourselves in vengeance."', '"The southern fortress taken by invaders? Heh, sure . . . when elephants fly."\\n—Brezard Skeinbow, captain of the guard', '"The tiniest mouse speaks louder to me than all the festival crowds on Tin Street."', '"There\'s no time to calm it down! Run!"', '"This footlight\'s broken. Get me a stagehand!"\\n—Judith', '"This is why we don\'t go out in banewasp weather."\\n—Rannon, Vithian holdout', '"This little piggy goes to war!"', '"This sort of innovation occurs when you set out to improve an electric tea kettle and misplace a decimal."', '"To a creature like that, we must seem like, well, bugs."\\n—Dars Gostok, Firefist captain', '"Too many have disappeared in these dark days. I am the light that will lead them home."', '"We\'re all food for something in the end."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"We\'ve merged your life essence with that of several creatures at once. You\'re welcome."\\n—Speaker Trifon', '"When the sky screams, when the ground groans, the End-Raze will soon begin."\\n—Nikya of the Old Ways', '"Within each of us, the potential for great power waits to be released."\\n—Zija, Simic mutationist', '"Would you give your life to save this world?" Gideon murmured. The pegasus snorted and spread wide its mighty wings.', '"You have the right to remain silent. Mostly because I tire of your excuses."', '"You say this Tenth District, not Rubblebelt. But where smash happen, that Rubblebelt. Rubblebelt state of mind."\\n—Urgdar, cyclops philosopher', '"You\'ve strayed, overworlder."', '"Your deed cannot be undone. You, however, can be."\\n—Agosto, Azorius imperator', '"Your potential to commit a crime warrants further investigation."', 'A hideous, living residue of countless corpses dissolving anonymously in the scummy depths.', 'A pet that can hunt both flesh and spirit is precious in a place where smiling assassins keep company with ghostly shadows.', 'A screech in the night is all it takes for Orzhov debtors to clutch at their coin purses.', 'All the wonders of the natural world in one breathtaking microcosm.', 'An Izzet experiment begins with a "what if," gets approved with a "why not," and concludes with a "eureka!"', 'An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members—and the doomed.', "As Ravnica's wilds expanded, even advocates for nature had to confront fiercer natural threats.", "As eons passed, the rock wore away, revealing the rich colors at the mountain's heart.", 'As far as the Orzhov Syndicate is concerned, it is the height of irresponsibility not to have a plan for your own ghost.', 'Beauty appears in strange places for those with eyes to see it.', 'Blood is holy to those whose god is War.', "Butcher's training, warrior's heart.", 'Common Gruul career aspirations: berserker, shaman, catapult.', 'Depending on your point of view, the seal represents a proud guardian of the natural cycle or one who has sold her soul to darkness for eternal life.', 'Dress for the job you want them to think you have.', 'Enter and comprehend the perfection of orchestrated life.', 'Enter and indulge your darkest fantasies, for you may never pass this way again.', 'Enter and leave the shackles of society behind.', 'Enter and rejoice! The Conclave stands united, open to one and all.', 'Enter the Senate, the seat of justice and the foundation of Ravnican society.', 'Even the darkest corners of Ravnica still lie in the shadow of the Church.', "Every laboratory buzzes with new experiments, each a piece of Ral's ambitious project.", 'Every part of the gate was reclaimed from forgotten ruins and imbued with new purpose by the Swarm.', 'Far from human eyes, birds flit between vivid blossoms in a hidden paradise.', 'Firemane Nevena led the victorious assault on the Barbu Rooftop rebels. Now the Gateless have marked her for death.', 'For most, war is a calamity. For some, an opportunity. And for the very few, a pleasure.', 'For the Simic Combine, its sigil serves not as an emblem of honor but as a trademark. Its familiar image on any biological commodity attests to superb craftsmanship, ingenious innovation, and higher cost.', 'Freed from their respective labs, the two weirds formed a partnership, feeding on the arcane energies of war.', 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'Gruul territorial markings need not be legible. The blood, snot, and muck used to smear them are unmistakably Gruul.', 'Havoc is a small price to pay for data.', "He has a job to finish, and it's you.", "He vowed he would never rest until he reached his destination. He doesn't know how right he was.", 'He wages war wherever the wind carries him.', 'Her footsteps are whispers, her passage a last breath.', 'Her theories are grounded. Her experiments are not.', 'Honor the gods of Theros, and they will return the favor.', "If you're lucky, the centaurs will give a single warning to leave their territory before driving a spear into you. If you're unlucky, the spear is the warning.", 'In the cold corridors of the undercity, misinformation unfurls from Duskmantle like a spreading stain.', 'In theory, the Guildpact keeps guild feuds from spiraling out of control. Personal feuds, however, are not covered.', 'In times of infestation and war, Zendikar favors the blades that strike in unison.', 'In times of peril, the vision the ancient paruns had for their city comes into focus.', "It is spring incarnate, its gentle warmth chasing away the last of winter's bite.", 'It\'s hard to shout "Shields up!" with a javelin in your chest.', 'Ivold gasped in surprise. Either a very strange insect had crawled onto one of the lenses or he was seeing geists at last!', "Krenko's hirelings are unflinchingly loyal.", 'Krushoks clear debris from fertile fields, fallow fields, and battlefields.', "Leonos had no second thoughts about the abolishment edict. He'd left skyrunes warning of the eviction, even though it was cloudy.", 'Looking over two city blocks of destruction, he could only cackle with pride.', 'Losing his possessions distressed him, but the lack of limbs was strangely liberating.', 'Made of bone and boiled in blood, a Rakdos signet is not considered finished until it has been used as a murder weapon.', 'Many chemisters are oblivious to the innumerable machinations of their guild, instead focusing obsessively on creating the perfect weird.', 'Mklthd had always hated crowds . . . and they had always hated him.', 'No duelist is without equal in Paliano.', 'No heartbeat to hear, no greed to bribe, no fear of death.', 'Not all storms come from the sky.', "Orzhov vampires look for allies in unlikely places in case their new guildmaster turns on them. The fate of the Obzedat is proof of Kaya's power and her hatred of the living dead.", 'Planeswalkers conjured replicas of old allies, reminders of the homeworlds that would fall next if Bolas prevailed.', 'Rain runoff in the Smelting District is known to spontaneously burst into flame.', "Rocs' innate fearlessness makes them ideal mounts for emergency response.", "Soaring over Vitu-Ghazi, New Prahv, and Orzhova, the Conclave's trained falcons provided critical intelligence.", 'Some who die senseless deaths return as formless spirits, seeking answers where there are none.', "The Gruul believe the best way to protect Ravnica's wilderness is to destroy civilization and all who defend it.", 'The Izzet signet is redesigned often, each time becoming closer to a vanity portrait of Niv-Mizzet.', 'The Simic use the claws as scalpels, while the Rakdos use them for tattooing and torture. The Gruul use them to pick their teeth after lunching on the rest of the carcass.', 'The arrival of the Planar Bridge caused eddies in the aether, creating some entirely new species while transforming others.', 'The flaming fist of Boros holds the promise of both protection and destruction in its grasp.', "The giant's real punishment was the fleeting moment when he was allowed to stand before being dragged down to his knees again.", 'The guildmasters loom large in the political sphere, but in the end, the rulers of Ravnica are its people.', 'The insectile kraul lurk in the tunnels below street level. Many are loyal to the Golgari Swarm, but others follow their own esoteric caste system.', 'The maze-like design embodies the core of Azorius law—strict structure designed to test wills and stall change.', "The problem isn't the indrik's enthusiasm, it's Ravnica's lack of guardrails.", 'The recruits had a lot to learn. Luckily, she had a lot to teach.', 'The sigil holds different meanings depending on its form and presentation. While some wear it as a sign of status, others wear it as a sign of debt.', 'The sky boiled over the citadel, dire and dark. Then the angels brought the dawn.', "The sparkmage shrieked, calling on the rage of the storms of his youth. To his surprise, the sky responded with a fierce energy he'd never thought to see again.", 'The streets of Ravnica are full of former guild members now using their institutional skills for personal gain.', 'The symbol of the Conclave is one of unity, with tree supporting sun and sun feeding tree.', "The upside to not thinking about the consequences is that you'll always surprise those who do.", 'They often perch on street lamps, causing the poles to buckle under their weight.', 'To the Rakdos, screams of delight and screams of terror are one and the same.', 'Two times the size, four times the smell.', 'Wealthier than ever thanks to exorbitant interest on wartime loans, the Orzhov only grew hungrier for more.', 'When he reaches for his key ring, you should be running for the exit.', 'When its power is threatened, the council speaks with a unified voice.', 'Wildflowers here bloom not with the season but with the ebb and flow of magic.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alex Konstad', 'Alexander Forssberg', 'Alexandre Honoré', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anna Pavleeva', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arthur Yuan', 'Aurore Folny', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Ben Maier', 'Ben Wootten', 'Betty Jiang', 'Billy Christian', 'Brian Valeza', 'Bryan Sola', 'Caio Monteiro', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Ostrowski', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Lockwood', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Darrell Riche', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Diana Cearley', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Drew Baker', 'Drew Tucker', 'Edgar Sánchez Hidalgo', 'Efrem Palacios', 'Ekaterina Burmak', 'Elizabeth Peiró', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Eytan Zana', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Forrest Imel', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Irina Nordsol', 'Iris Compiet', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jake Murray', 'James Paick', 'Janine Johnston', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jeff Simpson', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Tedrick', 'John Thacker', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jonathan Kuo', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Jung Park', 'Justine Cruz', 'Kai Carpenter', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kim Sokol', 'Kirsten Zirngibl', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Leon Tukker', 'Lindsey Look', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lorenzo Lanfranconi', 'Loïc Canavaggia', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Sass', 'Mila Pesic', 'Min Yum', 'Miranda Meeks', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils Hamm', 'Olena Richards', 'Pete Venters', 'Piotr Dura', 'Puddnhead', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Sara Winters', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stanton Feng', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tony Foti', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Uriah Voth', 'Valera Lutfullina', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zara Alfonso', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
